pe":"paragraph","text":"最近地震あるね＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしもの時のために\n備えておいた方がいいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/24/6033954/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"問題！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このピース\n誰の手でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超難問(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-20658":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/10/05/4357187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばそわヽ(^ω^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/10/05/4357187/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あの日　僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた」 の予告編が公開されました ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://youtu.be/1XHjDqJ20vw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のMVでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上小百合という、自分自身を演じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、これが案外難しかったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かに なり切って演じるのだったらもうそこに正解例があるから、やりやすいんですけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、場面場面で、「自分ならこういう時どうするのかな... 」って、考えながら撮影をしていったことにより、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「自分らしさ」というのが、よくわかった気がしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演劇部の発表会で、私とまりかは配役に選ばれず、裏方になってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、負けず嫌いの自分が悔しくない訳ないんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの顔を見て、咄嗟 に笑顔で話しかけたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以上にまりかの悔しくて悲しい気持ちが、すごくわかったから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆のことをいつも影で見守ってて、ほんとは色々知ってたけどわざと明るく振る舞って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘をついてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に、山下監督に「君は嘘がつけない子だ」と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われたことがあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし自分が誰かに対して嘘をつくなら、ああいうことしか出来ないんだろうな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋上でのクライマックス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、素で演じれた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このシーンは必見ですっ(   ^_^   )*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/10/05/4357187/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし誰かが泣いてたら、素の自分も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああいう行動とっちゃうだろうな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"淡くて、切なくて、キラキラ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその中に、友情とか絆とか、熱いものもある。"},{"type":"break"},{"